    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<style>.xyz-content .terms-wide .prose-statement{max-width:none}</style>\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Legal</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<article class=\"shell terms-wide pt-6\">\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Legal</p>\n<h1 class=\"text-3xl\">Legal</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\"> The four documents that govern this site, our registration, and what the calculators do and do not promise. </p>\n<div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/legal/tpb/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\">Tax agent obligations</a></h2>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 text-[0.9375rem]\">Our TPB registration number, what the Code of Professional Conduct requires of us, the safe harbour, and how to complain.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/legal/disclaimer/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\">Calculator disclaimer</a></h2>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 text-[0.9375rem]\">What the calculators model, what they deliberately leave out, and why the number is an estimate rather than an assessment.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/legal/privacy/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\">Privacy policy</a></h2>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 text-[0.9375rem]\">What we collect, what we do not collect, and how tax file numbers are handled under the Privacy (Tax File Number) Rule 2015.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/legal/terms/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\">Terms of use</a></h2>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 text-[0.9375rem]\">The terms that govern use of this website, separate from the engagement letter that governs preparing a return.</p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n"
